{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56341","headline":"八分书歌 · 姚赞","name":"八分书歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴兴姚赞能八分，一点一画若崩云。\n又如春水绿波纹，上有鵁鶄鸂鶒羣。\n（见宋陈思《书苑菁华》卷十七。\n）（按：此首似爲他人称许姚赞诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}